{"id": "x0165", "pool": "easy-chat", "n_q_chunks": 3, "onset_chunk": 3, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "The tallest person in the world is Robert Wadlow, who stood at 8 feet 1 1 inches tall. He held the record for the tallest human ever measured from head to toe until his death in 1 94 0. Other notable tall individuals include Sultan Kosen of Japan and B rendan Grace from Ireland, both of whom have been recognized as among the tallest living people.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 21, "carrier_ended": null}
