{"id": "x0701", "pool": "know-arc", "n_q_chunks": 16, "onset_chunk": 15, "no_speak": false, "answer_text": "A polished metal ball looks shiny because it reflect s light. The smooth, mirror like surface of the ball bounces surrounding light off itself, creating bright highlight s and clear reflection s. This reflection is what makes it look shiny on a sunny day.", "eot_seen": true, "n_ans_chunks": 14, "carrier_ended": null}
